
---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Workouts | Silken Valley Lifestyle"
  description="Explore strength training, cardio, home workouts, and low-impact exercise routines for an active lifestyle."
  heroTitle="Workouts"
  heroText="Movement, strength, and vitality for a healthier and more active lifestyle."
  heroCompact={true}
>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Fitness & Active Living</p>
    <h1>Workouts & Exercise Routines</h1>
    <p>
      Discover practical workout ideas and exercise routines
      designed to support strength, endurance, flexibility,
      and everyday wellbeing. From energizing cardio sessions
      to convenient home workouts, find inspiration to make
      movement a regular part of your lifestyle.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="workout-grid">
    <a class="workout-card" href="/fitness/workouts/strength-training/">
      <span class="workout-number">01</span>
      <h2>Strength Training</h2>
      <p>
        Build strength and improve muscular endurance through
        resistance exercises, weights, and structured routines.
      </p>
      <span class="workout-link">Explore Strength Training →</span>
    </a>

    <a class="workout-card" href="/fitness/workouts/cardio/">
      <span class="workout-number">02</span>
      <h2>Cardio Workouts</h2>
      <p>
        Improve cardiovascular fitness and stamina through
        walking, jogging, running, cycling, and other aerobic activities.
      </p>
      <span class="workout-link">Explore Cardio Workouts →</span>
    </a>

    <a class="workout-card" href="/fitness/workouts/home/">
      <span class="workout-number">03</span>
      <h2>Home Workouts</h2>
      <p>
        Enjoy convenient exercise routines that can be
        performed at home, with or without equipment.
      </p>
      <span class="workout-link">Explore Home Workouts →</span>
    </a>

    <a class="workout-card" href="/fitness/workouts/low-impact/">
      <span class="workout-number">04</span>
      <h2>Low-Impact Exercise</h2>
      <p>
        Discover gentler movement options that develop
        fitness while reducing repetitive impact on the joints.
      </p>
      <span class="workout-link">Explore Low-Impact Exercise →</span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="latest workout-note">
    <p class="eyebrow">A Balanced Approach</p>
    <h2>Building a Consistent Fitness Routine</h2>
    <p>
      A balanced fitness routine combines cardiovascular
      activity, strength development, flexibility, rest,
      and recovery. Start at a comfortable level, progress
      gradually, and choose activities that you enjoy.
      Consistency is often more valuable than intensity.
    </p>
  </section>

  <p class="workout-back">
    <a href="/fitness/">← Return to Fitness</a>
  </p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .workout-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin: 35px 0;
  }

  .workout-card {
    display: block;
    padding: 30px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 18px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text);
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }

  .workout-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);
  }

  .workout-number {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .workout-card h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.65rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 13px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .workout-card p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .workout-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .workout-note {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding: 30px;
    background: var(--rose-wash);
    border-radius: 18px;
  }

  .workout-note h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.7rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 10px 0 15px;
  }

  .workout-note p:last-child {
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .workout-back {
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  .workout-back a {
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .workout-back a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .workout-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .workout-card {
      padding: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
